  "briefing": "Dieter: Film the commercial within 50 seconds. Drive forward through the first two gates, stop, release and press brake again to reverse through the next two, then accelerate to stop and drive forward into the final compass-gate circuit. Route reversals represent the two 180 slides and the circuit represents the 360 spin; yaw and handbrake use are not scored. Manual transmission is not simulated. Direction-agnostic gates wait their turn on the overlapping route; cone contact fails.\nThe pad stands in for Weissach Skid Pad; its Boxster stands in for the 1998 Porsche 911 Carrera 3.4 Cabriolet (996). Police, traffic, vehicle damage and opponents are not simulated.",
